Third-party components
======================

This project does not relicense any third-party component. Each component keeps its own license.
Licenses below were read from the package metadata (License-Expression / License fields and the
bundled LICENSE files) of the versions pinned in uv.lock on 2026-10-21.

1. Distributed with this repository
-----------------------------------
None. The repository contains only original source code, configuration and documentation. Sample
images are generated locally by scripts/gen_samples.py and are not committed.

